# The run did not log its installed TerraTorch version.  Python 3.11, the
# 2026-08-31T07:47:18Z installation timestamp, and official dependency
# metadata constrain the resolver to TerraTorch 1.2.11 + TorchGeo 0.8.1:
# 1.2.12 and newer require TorchGeo 0.9.0, which requires Python >=3.12.
# TerraTorch 1.2.11 still requires NumPy >=2.2, so model execution remains
# isolated from the NumPy 1.26 scoring environment.
