# Exact CPython 3.11 / linux-x86_64 CUDA 12.6 wheels. Direct URLs prevent
# pip/uv index ordering from resolving a CPU wheel or a different platform.
# torch >= 2.10.0 REQUIRED: GHSA-53q9-r3pm-6pq6 (<=2.5.1) and
# GHSA-63cw-57p8-fm3p (<=2.9.1) — RCE in the weights_only unpickler.
